{"name": "Tetra Rise", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tetra Rise is an action-platformer roguelite where your goal is to escape a deep abyss filled with enemies and terrifying creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208050/extras/64a5a1d0dff94f85cef01594c6046c6b.poster.avif?t=1783015400\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208050/extras/64a5a1d0dff94f85cef01594c6046c6b.webm?t=1783015400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD YOUR WAY UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every defeated enemy turns into a fixed block you can use to climb closer to the surface.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect block colors to gain experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break blocks to earn coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies in strategic spots to obstruct paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stack pieces to forge your escape route</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run creates a unique block formation, and your path upward will always be different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"180\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208050/extras/5a9b023789b1cc19370a00fe24207e59.poster.avif?t=1783015400\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208050/extras/5a9b023789b1cc19370a00fe24207e59.webm?t=1783015400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208050/extras/5a9b023789b1cc19370a00fe24207e59.mp4?t=1783015400\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROGUELITE: EVERY ASCENT IS UNIQUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you gain experience, unlock and upgrade equipment that will help you take down bigger, stronger enemies. Combine items to create even more powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The roguelite loop throws you back to the bottom, but you <i>can</i> break the cycle! With each new attempt:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Review your stats from the previous run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve the base attributes of each piece of equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out new weapons and tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your playstyle and rise to the top!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"180\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208050/extras/66c13e9299b87ffc2352ec57efaff32d.poster.avif?t=1783015400\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208050/extras/66c13e9299b87ffc2352ec57efaff32d.webm?t=1783015400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208050/extras/66c13e9299b87ffc2352ec57efaff32d.mp4?t=1783015400\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Defeat countless enemies and escape the abyss! Tetra Rise is an action-platformer with roguelite elements, where you upgrade your equipment and face ever-growing hordes as you climb toward the surface.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208050/2824d2601a0a94a6e08d5cbf871b5e2e249a04a6/header.jpg?t=1783015400", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Casual", "Platformer", "Roguelike", "Bullet Hell", "Action Roguelike"], "developers": "Tora Games", "publishers": "Tora Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4208050", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "2 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/tTIUWcmHegU", "first_seen": 1787672363.555697}